---
// src/components/EditorialFeatures.astro
---
<section class="features flex flex-col gap-2 w-full max-w-[720px] mx-auto my-4 mb-8 px-0 box-border">
  <div class="feature-item bg-transparent text-terminal-body font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed font-normal">
    <span class="index font-mono text-terminal-dim text-[0.8rem] mr-1">[01]</span> <strong class="inline-block mr-2 text-terminal-bright font-mono text-[0.8rem] font-medium tracking-[0.02em]">STRUCT_REFACTOR:</strong> Mengubah susunan kalimat habis-habisan biar lolos cek plagiasi, tanpa ngubah makna aslinya.
  </div>
  <div class="feature-item bg-transparent text-terminal-body font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed font-normal">
    <span class="index font-mono text-terminal-dim text-[0.8rem] mr-1">[02]</span> <strong class="inline-block mr-2 text-terminal-bright font-mono text-[0.8rem] font-medium tracking-[0.02em]">CONTEXT_LOCK:</strong> Nggak cuma ganti kata, tapi nge-lock gaya bahasa dan nadanya biar hasilnya tetap enak dibaca.
  </div>
  <div class="feature-item bg-transparent text-terminal-body font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed font-normal">
    <span class="index font-mono text-terminal-dim text-[0.8rem] mr-1">[03]</span> <strong class="inline-block mr-2 text-terminal-bright font-mono text-[0.8rem] font-medium tracking-[0.02em]">PIPELINE_SYNC:</strong> Proses berantai ID→NL→EN→ID yang jalan otomatis, dengan notifikasi real-time di tiap tahapannya.
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .features { margin: 1rem auto 1.5rem; gap: 0.6rem; }
    .feature-item { font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  }
</style>